  "question": {
    "text": "A non-conducting ring having a uniform linear charge density <math><mi>λ</mi></math>&nbsp;is rotating with an angular speed <math><mi>ω</mi></math> about an axis passing through its centre and perpendicular to its plane. The magnetic field at its centre is"
  },
  "options": [
    {
